sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Donor
    participant Slot as Note Cavity / Sensors
    participant MCU as Hardware MCU (RP2040)
    participant App as live_camera.py
    participant YOLO as YOLO26n Detector
    participant MobNet as MobileNetV3-Large
    participant Valid as validator.py
    participant SQLite as donation_box.db
    participant JSONL as inference.jsonl
    participant PyBC as src/blockchain.py
    participant API as Blockchain API (:3000)
    participant Monad as Monad Testnet

    Donor->>Slot: Inserts banknote (e.g. ₹500)
    Slot->>MCU: Optical beam-break tripped
    MCU->>App: Serial packet {"event": "NOTE_INSERTED"}
    App->>App: Start 7.0s scan timer & open VideoCapture(0)
    
    loop Frame Capture (until detection or 7s)
        App->>YOLO: predict(frame, conf=0.25)
        YOLO-->>App: Bounding box [x1, y1, x2, y2], conf=0.89, class=5
    end

    Note over App: Detection acquired! Stop scanning immediately.
    App->>App: Crop note & resize to 224x224 RGB tensor
    App->>MobNet: Forward pass (eval_transform)
    MobNet-->>App: Softmax probabilities: Rs.500 = 99.94%
    App->>Valid: Evaluate decision thresholds
    Valid-->>App: decision = ACCEPT, target_bin = "BIN_500"

    Note over App,SQLite: Step 1 & 2: Local Persistence
    App->>JSONL: Append record to inference.jsonl
    App->>SQLite: import_single_record(record)
    SQLite-->>App: Insert confirmed (inserted=1, donation_id="47ab...")

    Note over App,MCU: Step 3: Hardware Safety Interlock
    App->>MCU: Serial command {"cmd": "DISPENSE", "target": "ACCEPT_BIN"}
    MCU->>Slot: Pulse vault solenoid (500 ms)
    Slot-->>Donor: Note drops into secure donation vault
    MCU->>MCU: Set RGB LED to Solid Green

    Note over App,Monad: Step 4: Blockchain Provenance (Async/Offline-Safe)
    App->>PyBC: register_blockchain_proof(record)
    PyBC->>API: POST /register-proof {proofHash, sourceId, donationId}
    API->>SQLite: Query row by donationId
    API->>API: Read mobilenet_v3_clean.pt -> compute modelHash
    API->>API: Create Canonical AI Event & compute canonical proofHash
    API->>Monad: contract.registerProof(proofHash, sourceId)
    Monad-->>API: Transaction receipt (txHash="0x8f2a...", block=1284950)
    API->>API: Save snapshot to original_records.json
    API-->>PyBC: 200 OK {success: true, transactionHash, blockNumber}
    PyBC-->>App: Blockchain registration complete
    App->>App: Release camera & close OpenCV windows

